                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I got this game from Groupees bundle , didn't expect so much from this indie game.\nAfter finishing one playthrough with normal difficulty , I wrote down my recommendation.\nAs the video, it's a low budget indie game as 6 dollars.\nBut it offers some kind of varieties from many kinds of units with different skill setup.\nYou can lead up to 8 units in your team, so it has some kind of replay value.\nThe pity thing is the rare items from one mission cannot keep for next ones.\n\nThe other reason I upvote is the Dev works very fast to fix/upgrade the game.",
